WEBVTT

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:31.893
we study human origins,

00:13:31.917 --> 00:13:35.292
but we have so few diverse scientists.

00:13:36.458 --> 00:13:40.101
And the thing is, these places
are full of students and academics

00:13:40.125 --> 00:13:42.518
who are desperate to collaborate,

00:13:42.542 --> 00:13:44.184
and the truth is

00:13:44.208 --> 00:13:45.934
that for them,

00:13:45.958 --> 00:13:48.542
they have fewer security issues than us.

00:13:50.458 --> 00:13:54.351
I think we constantly forget that for them
it's not a hostile environment;

00:13:54.375 --> 00:13:55.958
for them it's home.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.059
I'm telling you,

00:13:59.083 --> 00:14:03.559
research done in unstable places
with local collaborators